miat. Während des Wachstums wird hauptsächlich Acetat gebildet; größere Mengen von Formiat erscheinen unter den Gärungsendprodukten erst in der stationären Wachstumsphase.\nL35: C. formicoaceticum ist mesophil. Es unterscheidet sich von C. aceticum durch sein Unvermögen, mit Wasserstoff und Kohlendioxid zu wachsen. Weiterhin kann molekularer Wasserstoff auch in Gegenwart einer organischen Energiequelle von C. formicoaceticum nicht für die Acetatsynthese genutzt werden.\nL36: ## Summary\nL37: \nL38: A new species—Clostridium formicoaceticum—is described. It ferments fructose and several hexonic and hexuronic acids to acetate and formate. During active growth acetate is the main product of the fermentation. Considerable quantities of formate appear among the fermentation products in the stationary growth phase.\nL39: C. formicoaceticum is mesophilic. It differs from C. aceticum in its inability to grow on hydrogen plus carbon dioxide. Furthermore, hydrogen gas does not stimulate acetate production even in the presence of organic energy sources.\nL40: \nL41: This is a preview of subscription content, to check access.\nL42: ## Access this article\nL43: \nL44: Log in via an institution\nL45: \nL46: ## Subscribe and save\nL47: \nL48: Springer+\nL49: \nL50: from $39.99 /Month\nL51: \nL52:   * Receive 10 units per month\nL53:   * Download 1 article/chapter for 1 unit\nL54:   * Get selected eBooks for 7 units\nL55:   * Cancel anytime\nL56: 【18†View plans】\nL57: ## Buy Now\nL58: \nL59: [Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input][Input]\nL60: \nL61: Buy article PDF USD 39.95\nL62: \nL63: Price excludes VAT (USA)\nL64: Tax calculation will be finalised during checkout.\nL65: \nL66: Instant access to the full article PDF.\nL67: \nL68: 【19†Institutional subscriptions†www.springernature.com】\nL69: \nL70: ### Similar content being viewed by others\nL71: \nL72: 【20†Image†media.springernature.com】\nL73: ### 【21†Single and combined effects of acetic acid, furfural, and su